<page>
  <title>DevAlert Backend Settings using Local Storage</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>alert</keyword>
    <keyword>dev</keyword>
    <keyword>devalert</keyword>
    <keyword>cloud</keyword>
    <keyword>trace</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <section>
      <header>Overview</header>
      <text>
        <p>
					The settings here are for $PNAME to find your traces using your local file system.
				</p>

        <p>
          <A HREF="img/DevAlert_Storage_Settings_Local_Storage.png" target="$IMAGETARGET">
            <img src="img/DevAlert_Storage_Settings_Local_Storage.png" width="$IMAGEWIDTH" border="0" />
          </A>
        </p>

        <subsection>
          <header>Settings</header>
          <text>
            <p>
              Any path your computer can find can be used as the trace location. This can be on your local hard drive,
              on a shared network disc, or any other mapped storage.
            </p>
          </text>
        </subsection>
      </text>
    </section>
  </body>
</page>